# Exception: kasia-indexer ships in the kachat-app container and is built from a fresh clone by
# the Quick-Start panel. Commit its lockfile so builds are reproducible and a future crates.io
# yank of a transitive dep can't break a fresh resolve (a locked version is always allowed).
!kasia-indexer/Cargo.lock
